  },
  "section": "3.254",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the Hit Point Die from the Core Sorcerer Traits table.  \n- Gain the Sorcerer's level 1 features, which are listed in the Sorcerer Features table. See the multiclassing rules in “Character Creation” to determine your available spell slots."
}
